---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import WidgetLoader from '../../../../components/WidgetLoader.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <article class="topic-page">
    <span class="level-badge">Foundational</span>
    <h1>Atomic Structure</h1>
    <p>Nucleus, shells, and electron arrangement. Click the diagram parts to isolate them.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Concept</h2>
      <p>Atoms have a dense nucleus (protons + neutrons) with electrons in shells: 2, 8, 8, ... The shell pattern decides how an element bonds.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Interactive diagram — sodium atom</h2>
      <div class="widget" id="atom-widget">
        <svg width="320" height="240" viewBox="0 0 320 240" role="img" aria-label="Sodium atom shells">
          <circle id="nucleus" cx="160" cy="120" r="22" fill="#d4603e" opacity="1" style="cursor:pointer" />
          <text x="160" y="125" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff">Na</text>
          <ellipse id="shell1" cx="160" cy="120" rx="50" ry="50" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" style="cursor:pointer" />
          <ellipse id="shell2" cx="160" cy="120" rx="80" ry="80" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" style="cursor:pointer" />
          <ellipse id="shell3" cx="160" cy="120" rx="105" ry="105" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" style="cursor:pointer" />
          <circle cx="210" cy="120" r="6" fill="#333" />
          <circle cx="160" cy="40" r="6" fill="#333" /><circle cx="240" cy="120" r="6" fill="#333" /><circle cx="160" cy="200" r="6" fill="#333" />
          <circle cx="80" cy="120" r="6" fill="#333" /><circle cx="160" cy="55" r="6" fill="#333" /><circle cx="225" cy="120" r="0" fill="#333" />
          <circle cx="265" cy="120" r="6" fill="#d4603e" />
        </svg>
        <p>Click a shell or the nucleus to dim / restore it.</p>
        <WidgetLoader widgets={['diagramBuilder']} />
        <script type="module">
          document.querySelectorAll('#atom-widget svg [id]').forEach((n) => {
            n.addEventListener('click', () => {
              n.style.opacity = n.style.opacity === '0.25' ? '1' : '0.25';
            });
          });
        </script>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Step-by-step — electron configuration of sodium (Z=11)</h2>
      <div class="widget" id="config-widget">
        <WidgetLoader widgets={['equationStep']} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
